Origin
------
This repository is originated from and modelled on zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-plugins
(https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-plugins). Its repository layout,
registry.json schema, reproducible package format, retirement-ledger
semantics, and CI stage order are referenced from that project; the tooling
here is a smaller reimplementation of the same contract, not a copy. The
vendored wit/v0/ tree is upstream ZeroClaw code used verbatim.

